    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Creej's Corruption</i>&quot;  is a <strong> survival horror</strong> game which immerses players into the <strong>open world</strong> of Forenious to locate a missing friend. Go up against an <strong><u>AI that learns your tactics and predicts your actions.</u></strong> Every mistake you make is detrimental. Find your friend, and do <strong>NOT</strong> get caught.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/df66595afca6c0ed6c97b09bb281b51e.avif?t=1754860183\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/3c2e22028362c56f6dcf377a5108b3d5.poster.avif?t=1754860183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/3c2e22028362c56f6dcf377a5108b3d5.webm?t=1754860183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/3c2e22028362c56f6dcf377a5108b3d5.mp4?t=1754860183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The AI in this game is unlike most others. It takes note of <strong>EVERYTHING</strong> you do. Opened the front door and ran upstairs? It has taken note of that. Hid in a closet? It now knows where to check next. Ran around the house once? He will take a faster route next time.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/9b8c4201094d8c0c3e91f3c59f241066.avif?t=1754860183\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/bf6b160720c925955f4fdc2ade98e56d.poster.avif?t=1754860183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/bf6b160720c925955f4fdc2ade98e56d.webm?t=1754860183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/bf6b160720c925955f4fdc2ade98e56d.mp4?t=1754860183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the expansive open world featuring multiple Biomes, Towns, Neighborhoods, and characters who all have their own unique abilities and features. Embark on a 20+ hour main story with lots of cutscenes, side content, locations, and dangers to find your missing friend!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/824723c433a586a191da336e3f603ac7.avif?t=1754860183\" data-has-big /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.poster.avif?t=1754860183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.webm?t=1754860183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420700/extras/1082aceef329afd59ac99a38960fb013.mp4?t=1754860183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
