    "short_description": "When walking home from lunch, your friend is violently snatched before your eyes. As you start your journey to find him, you realize there's something much, MUCH worse going on. Face SUPER advanced NPCs that learn your tactics and predict your actions. Mistakes are DETRIMENTAL.",
